  "description": "Graffiti Impact is a bold and energetic graffiti brush font inspired by urban street culture, hip-hop art, and modern graffiti lettering. With its rough brush strokes, hand-painted texture, and rebellious attitude, this font delivers a powerful visual impact that instantly grabs attention.\nPerfect for designers who want to create authentic street-style artwork, Graffiti Impact brings a raw and expressive look to posters, album covers, clothing brands, social media graphics, event flyers, YouTube thumbnails, gaming designs, and urban-inspired branding.\nWhether you’re designing for a music project, streetwear collection, skate brand, or creative poster, this font adds a fearless and artistic edge to your work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Graffiti Impact is a bold and energetic graffiti brush font inspired by urban street culture, hip-hop art, and modern graffiti lettering. With its rough brush strokes, hand-painted texture, and rebellious attitude, this font delivers a powerful visual impact that instantly grabs attention.</p>\n<p>Perfect for designers who want to create authentic street-style artwork, Graffiti Impact brings a raw and expressive look to posters, album covers, clothing brands, social media graphics, event flyers, YouTube thumbnails, gaming designs, and urban-inspired branding.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for a music project, streetwear collection, skate brand, or creative poster, this font adds a fearless and artistic edge to your work.</p>",
